  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit Guarantee Scheme in Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kreditgarantisystem i Ukraina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige st&#xF6;djer OECDs &quot;Sector Competitiveness Strategy for Ukraine&quot;,  sedan 2009. En av policy rekommendationerna inom jordbrukssektorn som OECD f&#xF6;reslagit &#xE4;r att Ukraina b&#xF6;r uppr&#xE4;tta ett kreditgarantisystem   inom jordbruket f&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ka utl&#xE5;ningen och investeringar f&#xF6;r sm&#xE5; och  medelstora jordbruksf&#xF6;retag. Detta projekt p&#xE5; tv&#xE5; &#xE5;r syftar till att  unders&#xF6;ka m&#xF6;jligheterna att utveckla ett kreditgarantisystem.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden is supporting the OECD &quot;Sector Competitiveness Strategy for    Ukraine&quot;, 2009 -2015. Key sectors are agribusiness, machinery and     transport equipment manufacturing, renewable and energy-efficiency    technologies sectors. As a complement to the above, Sida is proposed  to support a Credit Guarantee Scheme for Small and Medium Enterprises in agribusiness (2013-2015).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Action is to enhance access to finance for Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs) in Ukraine&#x2019;s agribusiness sector. Building on Phase II of the project &#x201C;Sector Competitiveness Strategy for Ukraine&#x201D;, the objective of the Action is to put in place the conditions for establishing a CGS which would initially focus on agricultural SMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
